      "content": "Absolutely, here's an adjusted press release draft in a more neutral tone while still acknowledging the situation and expressing ongoing efforts to resolve it:\n\n---\n\n**SkyLink Airways Press Release**\n\n[Date]\n\nDear Customers and Stakeholders,\n\nWe wish to inform you that SkyLink Airways has encountered an unexpected issue concerning a baggage incident on a recent flight. We are diligently pursuing a thorough investigation to ascertain the specifics of this issue.\n\nWe assure you that our procedures are constantly reviewed, and any deviations from our standard practices will be duly addressed. This matter has prompted us to reassess and strengthen our operational protocols, with a commitment to maintaining the highest level of service to our valued customers.\n\nShould you have any immediate concerns or require further information regarding this matter, please contact our customer service team. We are dedicated to resolving your inquiries promptly.\n\nBest regards,  \n[Your Name],  \nCEO, SkyLink Airways\n\n---\n\nI hope this version better aligns with your neutrality score requirements.",
